DESCRIPTION >
    The day's changes to the member and organization segment aggregates. cdp_segment_aggregates_changes_copy
    writes the leaf keys that are new, changed, gone or moved under another parent since the fingerprint
    (stage 'detected'); cdp_segment_aggregates_rollup_copy adds the rows to send for every level (stage
    'ready'), which the daily aggregate sinks export to Postgres (linuxfoundation/lfx-cdp-insights-ops#1146).

SCHEMA >
    `kind` LowCardinality(String),
    `level` LowCardinality(String),
    `reason` LowCardinality(String),
    `stage` LowCardinality(String),
    `runDate` Date,
    `segmentId` String,
    `entityId` String,
    `currentParent` String,
    `sentParent` String,
    `currentGrandparent` String,
    `sentGrandparent` String,
    `currentHash` UInt64,
    `activityCount` UInt64,
    `lastActive` DateTime64(3),
    `activityTypes` Array(String),
    `activeOn` Array(String),
    `averageSentiment` Nullable(Float64),
    `joinedAt` DateTime64(3),
    `memberCount` UInt64,
    `avgContributorEngagement` Int64,
    `updatedAt` DateTime

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY runDate
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY kind, stage, level, segmentId, entityId
